# Camera originals — 31 GB of Sony ARW/MP4 masters. Never commit these:
# GitHub rejects single files over 100 MB and the clone would be unusable.
# Keep the masters local; web-ready derivatives go in public/ or R2.
assets/Hotel Thakali Inn Reels n photos/
*.ARW
*.arw
*.MP4
*.mp4
*.MOV
*.mov

# ...except the web-ready derivatives, which are small enough to ship and are
# what the site actually loads. Regenerate with scripts/encode-ambient.sh
!public/media/ambient.mp4
# ...and the gallery clips, exported by scripts/export-gallery-clips.mjs
!public/media/gallery/*.mp4

